          "text": "Coordinate a scheduled Bakersfield pickup based on equipment volume, loading conditions, project timing, and organizational requirements.",
          "image": "https://www.stselectronicrecyclinginc.com/images/2017/compressed/mac-2585220_1920.jpg"
        },
