          "position": 3,
          "name": "Prepare Equipment",
          "text": "Identify data-bearing devices, separate equipment categories if requested, and make equipment accessible for collection according to the agreed logistics plan.",
          "image": "https://www.stselectronicrecyclinginc.com/images/2017/compressed/mac-2585220_1920.jpg"
