          "image": "https://www.stselectronicrecyclinginc.com/images/2017/compressed/mac-2585220_1920.jpg"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 5,
          "name": "Process Electronics",
          "text": "Collected technology is evaluated and processed through responsible downstream recycling workflows with attention to data-bearing devices and material recovery.",
