            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS adheres to NIST 800-88 guidelines for data sanitization, maintains rigorous chain of custody tracking, and follows procedures designed to support compliance with HIPAA, ISO 27001, and California universal waste management standards across Bakersfield operations."
