            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We provide scheduled pickups throughout Bakersfield, Oildale, Rosedale, Stockdale, and neighboring communities, extending into Shafter, Wasco, Delano, and the southern San Joaquin Valley along California State Route 99."
