        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is enterprise electronics pickup really free?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, corporate collections are complimentary for qualifying equipment quantities in Bakersfield and Kern County. We evaluate inventory manifests to confirm qualifying volume and provide transparent coordination with no surprise collection surcharges."
