            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Collected items in Bakersfield are staged securely before transfer to specialized processing operations in Jacksonville, Texas and Houston, Texas. Storage hardware undergoes verified sanitization, while raw materials are recovered through zero landfill recovery processes."
